    "name": "Shattered Spines",
    "steam_appid": 3504820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Spines is a fast-paced, precision platformer designed specifically for speedrunners. Run, jump, dash, and slide through each level. Each map is short but packed with opportunities to shave off precious seconds as you race against the clock. Set a personal best or compete globally for the fastest times! Perfect your technique, push your limits, and join the race for the top spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense, Bite-Sized Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is short but packed with challenges. They\u2019re designed for speedrunners, where every second is an opportunity to shave off time. Quick to start, impossible to put down, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete Across the Globe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other speedrunners around the world, rise to the top of the leaderboard, and prove your mastery of every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Spines was built with speedrunners in mind. Whether you\u2019re grinding to beat your personal best or chasing glory on the global stage, every second is a thrilling challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Evolving Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly improving. Current assets are placeholders, but the final version promises stunning visuals to match the intensity of the gameplay. Stay tuned for updates as Shattered Spines evolves!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Spines is a fast-paced, precision platformer designed specifically for speedrunners. Run, jump, dash, and slide through each level. Each map is short but packed with opportunities to shave off precious seconds as you race against the clock. Set a personal best or compete globally for the fastest times! Perfect your technique, push your limits, and join the race for the top spot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense, Bite-Sized Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is short but packed with challenges. They\u2019re designed for speedrunners, where every second is an opportunity to shave off time. Quick to start, impossible to put down, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete Across the Globe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other speedrunners around the world, rise to the top of the leaderboard, and prove your mastery of every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Built for Speedrunning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Spines was built with speedrunners in mind. Whether you\u2019re grinding to beat your personal best or chasing glory on the global stage, every second is a thrilling challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Evolving Visuals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is constantly improving. Current assets are placeholders, but the final version promises stunning visuals to match the intensity of the gameplay. Stay tuned for updates as Shattered Spines evolves!</p>",
